  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: Laura16
  <Text>k__BackingField: I have one more idea, though it may be a terrible one. I've
    heard that some perfumes are made from the scent glands of creatures, and well,
    nothing has a stronger scent than <style=enemy>stinkshrooms</style>. Maybe their
    <style=item>sticky sap</style> could work?
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Let's try it.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8925258bb7cc8574199b39494c6f3da1, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Yep, a terrible idea.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 810090d3294b40f42aa5060b8ea8ecc3, type: 2}
